Package: fldigi-subspace
Version: @VERSION@
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libfltk1.3t64 | libfltk1.3, libfltk-images1.3t64 | libfltk-images1.3, libhamlib4t64 | libhamlib4, libpng16-16t64 | libpng16-16, libportaudio2, libpulse0, libsamplerate0, libsndfile1, libudev1, libx11-6, libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, libc6
Maintainer: WM8Q <ssdev.avantol@xoxy.net>
Homepage: https://github.com/avantol/fldigi-subspace
Description: fldigi with faster flrig PTT for Subspace Edition
 fldigi 4.2.13 (W1HKJ and the fldigi developers, GPL-3.0) changed so that,
 with rig control through flrig, the radio keys as soon as fldigi decides to
 transmit instead of after its flrig poll cycle and receive loop wind down
 (median 70 ms -> 20 ms on the bench). Meant for stations that share one
 radio between several programs through flrig (MAGNET). Installs beside a
 stock fldigi as fldigi-subspace, with its own data folder; both use
 ~/.fldigi and the same ports, so run one at a time.
